('Elie Hassenfeld', 'GiveWell', NULL, '2006-08-01', 'month', '2007-08-01', 'month', 'https://web.archive.org/web/20100609155532/https://www.givewell.org/about/people https://web.archive.org/web/20101120092215/https://www.givewell.org/about/people', 'One of the original eight part-time volunteers in the project founded August 2006; left his previous job in August 2007 to work on GiveWell full-time. No operational title stated. Volunteer phase closed at the explicitly stated transition.', 'volunteer', 'Effective altruism'), /*Closed*/
